8 16 53 charli great work evan the ui look realli polish\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e93a56d68a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-18-electron-package-test.md\", \"id\": \"5bb4b4cf41eb25a2\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.23819056771449032, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.059221975306414744, \"vector_similarity\": 0.65578395, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-18-electron-package-test.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e93a56d68a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-18-electron-package-test.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-18-electron-package-test.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 869, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:22\", \"token_count\": 281, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-38\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Title**: Author and publish bare-metal performance benchmarks\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-05\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nProduce repeatable bare-metal performance benchmarks to support release performance claims. Benchmark scripts were authored and briefly blocked while a dedicated bare-metal environment was provisioned, then rerun once the node was available; results were published, depending on the completed multi-threading baseline.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-38\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Title**: Author and publish bare-metal performance benchmarks\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-05\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Repeatable bare-metal benchmark scripts exist for local node performance.\\n\\n- Benchmarks run to completion on a dedicated bare-metal node.\\n\\n- Published results depend on and reflect the completed multi-threading baseline.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-38\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Title**: Author and publish bare-metal performance benchmarks\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-05\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nProduce repeatable bare-metal performance benchmarks to support release performance claims. Benchmark scripts were authored and briefly blocked while a dedicated bare-metal environment was provisioned, then rerun once the node was available; results were published, depending on the completed multi-threading baseline.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-38\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-38\\n\\n**Title**: Author and publish bare-metal performance benchmarks\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-05\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-05**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because bare-metal performance benchmarks are required for release claims.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-12**: Diana - Publish Results (Completed)\\n\\n - *Published the bare-metal benchmark results, once rerun on the provisioned node, depending on the completed multi-threading baseline.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 38 sourc id src cu ciph 38 task id ciph 38 titl author and publish bare metal perform benchmark status complet assigne evan prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 05 descript produc repeat bare metal perform benchmark to support releas perform claim benchmark script were author and briefli block while a de